window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>**Part 1**</p> <p>Bad boys have never been my thing.</p> <p>I’ve seen firsthand the kind of devastation they can cause. That’s why I go for safe. Predictable. Guys who will take whatever I’m willing to give. That way, I always have the upper hand, ensuring that my heart remains unscathed.</p> <p>There is only one problem. None of those men have ever made my heart beat faster, or made me feel out of control. That is, until him.</p> <p>I live by one rule. Treat others the same way they treat me. So, if Sylar treats me as though I’m his world, does it matter that technically he is not a good man? He’s good to me. He’s good for me. At least that’s what I’m gambling on. With the one thing I swore I’d never risk. My heart.</p>"; 
